AicpOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

Please see the [AicpOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for building instructions, by device.


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via AicpOS Gerrit!

Simply follow our guide on [how to submit patches](https://wiki.lineageos.org/submitting-patch-howto.html).

To view the status of your and others' patches, visit [AicpOS Gerrit Code Review](https://review.lineageos.org/).


Buildbot
--------

All supported devices are built weekly and periodically as changes are committed to ensure the source trees remain buildable.

You can view the current build statuses at [AicpOS Buildkite](https://buildkite.com/lineageos).

Builds produced weekly by the buildbot can be downloaded from [AicpOS downloads](https://download.lineageos.org/).
